        {
          "question": "e-4709",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Consider the following system of linear equations:\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041946/assets/da382fddc670e2fc67e17e57db051ccde17d7af1bae0846e1d88e63efa2f02b2.png)\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form, and then solve the linear system.",
