      "source": [
        {
          "question": "e-6234",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "The augmented matrix for this system is\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041946/assets/64b09692fa9522b79d0a8d481b4c997733bc5643cb56d2bc66eadce36d7bcc21.png)\n\nTransforming $M$ to reduced row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}2 & -6 & 2 & 8 \\\\ -6 & 18 & -6 & -24 \\\\ 4 & -12 & 4 & 16\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 1 & 4 \\\\ -6 & 18 & -6 & -24 \\\\ 4 & -12 & 4 & 16\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+6{R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 4 & -12 & 4 & 16\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-4){R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041946/assets/87e2576078acd244370d76da3c885fb24846e2bf560a0a1dbed4319f653d86bb.png)",
